    "short": "Rise and Survive is a progression-based apocalypse addon where zombies grow stronger every day.",
    "description": "Evolving Zombies & Growing Difficulty\nA dynamic difficulty bar increases every day, boosting zombie spawn rates.\nEvery 8 days, zombies move faster, grow stronger, and may unlock new abilities.\nHigher difficulty = higher chance of zombies spawning with armor and weapons.\nUnique Zombie Classes - Each zombie type brings new threats, new behaviors, and new strategies:\nMiner Zombies – break blocks to reach you (faster on higher difficulty).\nBlock Placer Zombies – tower up, bridge, and chase you no matter how high you build.\nWitch Zombies – throw and drink potions.\nBomber Zombies – throw TNT (damage-only).\nEnder Zombies – teleport using ender pearls.\nJumpers – leap at you and onto blocks.\nCrawlers – crawl through small spaces.\nRevealers – scream to expose your location, then flee.\nSpitter - shoots spit from a distance.\nHorde Leaders\n\nGiant – jumps and summons fangs.\nTank – incredibly tough.\nNecromancer – summons more zombies.\nZombies can also spawn with various potion effects like Speed or Fire Resistance.\nAll vanilla hostile mobs are disabled, but their loot is obtainable by killing zombies.\nHorde & Blood Moon System\nBloodmoon occurs every 8 days\nHordes spawn randomly 15 blocks away, always aware of your location.\nHorde size scales with difficulty (customizable in settings).",
